<!-- The W.D. Tex. motion's Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs) in the face of the typst
     template ({font}, Times New Roman) at 12 pt (CV-10(a): 12-point or larger; size 24 half points); Body Text in exact
     24 pt line boxes (typst pitch-double, CV-10(a) double spaced) with a half-inch indent, and the headings in them;
     the court title, caption, contents, quotation, signature and footer lines in 14.4 pt boxes (typst pitch-single);
     letter page with 1-inch margins on all sides (CV-10(a)) and a centered page number, its line 36 pt above the page
     foot (720 twips: where typst sets it, footer-descent 30 %). docx/txwd-motion-brief.lua writes every paragraph's
     own spacing and the contents' page numbers (fb render's needles). Twips: 20 x pt. -->
<reference xmlns:w="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" base="xengine" size="24" body="480" single="288" indent="720" heading="480" heading-before="0" heading-after="0" footer="720"/>
